  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/banner-vulcans-flashlights.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong>開發暫緩，至少在可預見的未來皆是如此。<br>SWE/M 團隊目前無法撥出時間來修復、移植或升級此模組。<br>對於造成的不便，我深感抱歉。我們會回到這個專案，只是尚不確定何時。</strong></span><br><br><br></p>\n<h4><strong>新增內容 - <em><span style=\"color:#930;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">包含什麼？</span></em></strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>手電筒</li>\n<li>強力手電筒</li>\n<li>礦工頭盔</li>\n<li>強力礦工頭盔</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>合成配方 - <span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#930\"><em>如何製作！</em></span></strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">---&gt;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"> 手電筒：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/jV7image.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">---&gt;</span>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong> 強力手電筒：&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/1CQimage.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">---&gt;</span>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong> 礦工頭盔：&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/928956/description_a9706ec4-a716-4c92-8024-ad556ba207ea.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>---&gt;</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong> 強力礦工頭盔：&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/ZLFimage.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><strong>如何為它們充電？</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>使用<span style=\"color:#f00\">紅石</span>粉修復手電筒。使用<span style=\"color:#f00\">紅石</span>塊修復強力手電筒。不需要鐵砧。</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>功能 - <span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><span style=\"color:#930\">它們能做什麼？</span></em></span></strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>手電筒與頭盔會在黑暗時引導你穿過洞穴與海洋，無需不斷放置火把或螢石</li>\n<li>電力低時會閃爍</li>\n<li>物品/實體可能導致閃爍，並加速耗電</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>設定選項 - <span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#930\"><em>如何調整某些設定？</em></span></strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>我們的許多功能都是可選的，你可以透過設定檔來自訂模組！（如果不熟悉的話，在 YouTube 搜尋「如何更改模組設定檔」會很有幫助！）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>閃爍功能的開關</li>\n<li>閃爍外觀的開關（適合感官敏感者）</li>\n<li>方塊/實體列表 + 閃爍倍率</li>\n<li>方塊/實體列表 + 耗電倍率</li>\n<li>閃爍範圍（方塊/實體觸發閃爍效果的距離）</li>\n<li>耗電範圍（方塊/實體觸發耗電效果的距離）</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p><strong>----------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>感謝名單：</em></strong><br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;製作負責人&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>AlaharranHonor<br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.20 開發者&nbsp; ||&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Quarris<strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;光影&nbsp; ||&nbsp; </strong>AlexModGuy (參考 Alex's Caves，LGPL)<br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;素材與紋理&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>AlaharranHonor<br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;委託人&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>Vulcan</p>\n<p><em><strong>版權、整合包與影片：</strong></em></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><strong>版權&nbsp; ||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>LGPL 3.0<br><strong>整合包&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>無需掛名，但請聯絡我們，讓我們也能一起遊玩！<br><strong>影片&nbsp; &nbsp; ||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>歡迎告知我們，我們會分享給朋友們！</p>",
